read_notifications() returns your round briefing; call it at startup and after a round changes. read_notifications(wait_for='message') waits until a message arrives on {% if chat %}one of your channels{% else %}your team's channel{% endif %}. read_notifications(wait_for='next_round') declares you are done with this round and waits for the next briefing. The result lists the wake reasons, any briefings, the messages received and a notice when the wait was cut short; type done ends the session.
